WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Save your song as a LYNX project: File, Save as, then a name.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.200
A project keeps everything: patterns, Mixer, plugins and their settings.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:20.200
After a change, press Ctrl+S. The old file goes to the backups.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:26.000
Trying an idea? File, Save new version: My beat 2, next to the first.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.000
LYNX also keeps backups while you work.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:37.600
File, Versions lists the saved versions and the backups. Open any one as a copy.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.800
Changed your mind? File, Revert to last backup brings the project back.
